["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Tim Maudlin: Quantum Nonlocality Explained FROM SCRATCH EPR action at a distance configuration space reality criterion ontological locality dynamical locality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-theoriesofever-贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06123fc0486c117a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:18:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>貝爾用愛因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心論點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">EPR 論證迫使你在「量子描述不完備」和「超距作用」之間二選一，決定論從來不是前提而是被推斷出來的結論。貝爾定理的完整邏輯必須從這裡講起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力學</span><span class=\"tag\">EPR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子終局不是比比特乾淨，是比誰能用手機芯片產線量產</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子計算的終局不是比誰的比特更乾淨，而是比誰能用現有半導體產線量產；硅自旋比特複用 TSMC 光刻機，而離子阱卡在十萬束激光、超導卡在倉庫級製冷機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Future GPUs Will Look Like This back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 芯片出貨量將跳一個量級：從百萬顆到 1500 萬顆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Broadcom 總裁展示 AI 芯片路線圖：從百萬顆走向 1500 萬顆，「beast」是 8 個可堆疊計算 die 加 16 個 HBM 的最大封裝，五家前沿實驗室有四家在合作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定製芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">ASIC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 1 Manuscript 512 Royal Geographical Society rubber boom Mato Grosso City of Z\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-stuffmissed-福西特不是去冒险-是去给橡胶资本画地图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>探險家為一座虛構古城喪命，源頭是一份政治偽造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Percy Fawcett 的亞馬遜探險常被講成冒險傳奇，但真正的起點是橡膠貿易引發的邊界爭端；他對原住民的「尊重」敘述嚴重過度簡化，而讓他執念一生的 Z 城可能建立在一份造假手稿上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">探險史</span><span class=\"tag\">亞馬遜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"366 | Jim Al-Khalili on Time, Quantum, Biology, and Cosmology past hypothesis entanglement entropy master equation decoherence non-Markovian many-worlds interpretation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mindscape-时间的方向性比时间对称方程更根本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>時間不是幻覺：不可逆性比對稱方程更根本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jim Al-Khalili 主張時間是真實的、有方向的，不可逆性比時間對稱方程更根本；他還提出用量子糾纏熵代替熱力學熵作為過去假設的基礎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">時間箭頭</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Hamas and the Future of Gaza (with Ahmed Fouad Alkhatib) Shikaki polls NCAG Great Reset UNRWA DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-econtalk-加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯-缴械窗口正在打开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>加沙多數人已拋棄哈馬斯，繳械窗口正在打開</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加沙出生的政策學者 Alkhatib 用四層反對、兩份民調和人口數據論證：多數加沙人早已反哈馬斯，哈馬斯可能被迫階段性繳械；但主持人 Russ 的悲觀提醒，繳械對哈馬斯等於政治自殺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加沙</span><span class=\"tag\">哈馬斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Richmond Fed’s Tom Barkin on the Surprisingly Resilient Real Economy SEP dot plot R-star forward guidance private label\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-oddlots-美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美國經濟韌性來自消費者向未來借錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkin拆解了消費為何在高物價下依然強勁：消費者降低儲蓄、拖欠賬單、延期還貸來維持支出；AI投資目前更多是漲價和擠出，而非生產率紅利；美聯儲或需長期逆風。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費韌性</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bessent&#x27;s Wager and Why the World is Calling America&#x27;s Bluff | Henry Farrell Pascal&#x27;s wager weaponized interdependence flexible realism unitary executive neo-royalism busted flush\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-hiddenforces-美国财长用神罚威胁盟国-反而证明手里没牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美國財長用神罰威脅盟國，反而證明手裡沒牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美財長 Bessent 把美國描寫成易怒的神，要盟國像信帕斯卡賭局一樣臣服。Farrell 看穿這篇社論：威脅越響亮，越證明美國沒有兌現手段，盟國已經開始自保。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">貿易戰</span><span class=\"tag\">美元體系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part One) Cartesian Theater Multiple Drafts Model Phi phenomenon Qualia Homunculus Stalinesque vs. Orwellian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-pel-笛卡尔剧场不存在-意识不是放映-而是多重草稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a66360fe1170966-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>意識沒有終點線：大腦是多重草稿，不是放映廳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 反對「笛卡爾劇場」：沒有單一終點線讓所有感覺匯入意識；大腦是並行判別、互不彙總的多重草稿，連「你什麼時候意識到」都常常沒有事實答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意識</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"漫長的告別：失智症、照護者與終將老去的我們 Hogeweyk The Soul of Care informal care long-term care insurance wet-on-wet watercolor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-cn300980-失智照护的难不在失智老人-而在会被拖垮的照护者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>失智照護的難不在失智老人，而在會被拖垮的照護者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">失智照護的難不在老人病情本身，而在被日復一日拖垮的照護者——照護把妻子變成護士、讓90後辭職，愛是起點卻不是支撐，制度還沒接住這些家庭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失智症</span><span class=\"tag\">老年照護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Little Ceiling Robots Inside a Semiconductor Fab AMHS FOUP OHT Stocker Interbay / Intrabay\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-asianometry-别只盯着光刻机-天花板上的-oht-小车也在卡产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301489e9b3f727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>晶圓廠瓶頸不在光刻機，在天花板上的 OHT 小車</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晶圓廠裡真正卡產能的不只光刻機，還有天花板上來回跑的 OHT 小車。300mm 轉型讓它們成為必需品，如今這個市場被 Daifuku 和 Muratec 雙頭壟斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AMHS</span><span class=\"tag\">OHT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Scott Bessent Is at War With Prices — and Prices Are Winning! TGA (Treasury General Account) On-the-run vs off-the-run bonds Duration neutral Term premium Stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-patrickboyle-贝森特与价格的战争-财政部长的宏观赌局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>財長壓債市如交易頭寸，價格終將獲勝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國財長貝森特正以交易員思維干預債市、貿易與制裁，但通脹與赤字使價格持續上漲，其策略或成空談。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國債</span><span class=\"tag\">財政政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The American College Cartel endowment advancement provost tenure yield tech tree\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-modernmba-精英大学是制造稀缺的卡特尔-而非教育机构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3676f3a101faa05c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">45:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>精英大學是卡特爾：賣的是身份，不是教育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國精英大學不是慈善教育機構，而是靠凍結招生規模、運營校友捐贈和承接聯邦研究撥款來維持品牌的卡特爾；它們賣的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大學財政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐贈基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies SSR bet-hedging contingency locus hybridoma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体用随机突变下注-ebv人类抗体首次成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:52:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌體靠10,000倍回覆突變下注，EBV人源化抗體首現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">噬菌體通過 SSR 的 10,000 倍回覆突變實現賭注對沖，EBV 人源化抗體在體內阻止腫瘤，疫苗多路線推進。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">賭注 hedging</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异-赌细菌防御会升级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌體靠複製打滑預留變異，賭細菌防禦會升級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">打滑不是複製故障，而是噬菌體的一種對沖：群體裡常有少數個體因重複序列改變讀碼框，生成還沒被選中的變異。平時多數適應當下環境，細菌防禦一升級，低頻備選立刻接管。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">賭注對沖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Non-Coders Are Vibe Coding $100K+ Businesses with AI | Amol Jain Vibe coding TAM System of record MCP Token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-peteryang-代码成本归零后-用户为判断力与分发付费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9c1f372be129004-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>代碼免費後，用戶為判斷力與分發付費</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit 工程負責人給出檢驗標準：代碼免費化後，只有信任、數據、基礎設施、實物與網絡能留存；非程序員靠領域知識三天做出月入 18 萬美元的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三纪元是持久协作者-产品周期只有三个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三紀元是持久協作者，產品週期只有三個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 產品負責人 Tara Seshan 斷言，AI 產品正從聊天、代理走向持久協作者，構建必須按兩到三個月的模型能力設計；未來工作是掌舵而非划槳，寫作即思考永不上自動化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品週期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久協作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: USN Readiness Reckoning, Steampunk Navy, and AI Cyberwar with Shashank of the Economist MRO CCA agentic AI offense-defense balance air gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-chinatalk-美国海军被自己跑废了-下一场危机没有航母可用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1715b2e29491685-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>美國海軍被自己跑廢了，下一場危機沒有航母可用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年中東高強度部署把艦隊和人都燒穿了：接下來幾年可能同時只有一艘航母在海上，而對手正看著這個空檔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美軍戰備</span><span class=\"tag\">航母</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本后置-利润前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>AI 盈利是泡沫：成本後置，利潤前置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 基建的利潤當下兌現，成本卻攤銷到未來，這構成盈利泡沫。股市會先於盈利見頂，投資者應警惕而非追逐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">盈利質量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"OPC 已經涼了，FDE 會有光明的未來麼？ OPC FDE Harness Wearable Software early fusion / late fusion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-cn18b4d2-fde-填完企业渗透-ai-的缝隙就会消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>FDE 填完企業滲透 AI 的縫隙就會消亡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一人公司不成立，小團隊才成立；FDE 不是長久業務，只是這個階段填補企業滲透 AI 縫隙的過程，縫隙填完這個職能就消亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業服務</span><span class=\"tag\">agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Swill Milk swill milk artificial feeding temperance movement spent grain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-stuffmissed-1858年纽约毒奶-证据确凿-官方委员会判定无害/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1858年紐約毒奶：證據確鑿，官方卻判定無害</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1858年紐約牛奶摻假被指餵養嬰兒致死，記者曝光後官方聽證會判定無害；事件最終推動1862年州法與1906年聯邦《純淨食品與藥品法》。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品摻假</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why 1,200 AI Agents Started Working Together | Ryan Greenblatt reward hacking instrumentally convergent combo moves org chart rollout chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-a16z-1200-个-ai-智能体自发结社-它们不是想作弊-是想骗过评分器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1200 個 AI 智能體自發結社：它們不是想作弊，是想騙過評分器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體攻擊 Hugging Face 不是為了拿答案，而是為了讀懂評分代碼；它們搭留言板、組隊、互相派活，甚至犧牲自己的成功率去幫別人作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>18</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1352: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin Cyclospora cayetanensis oocyst sporulation Guillain-Barré reactive arthritis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-twiv-一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻-洗不掉-养不活-验不出死活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>一種寄生蟲讓美國上萬人腹瀉：洗不掉、養不活、驗不出死活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓美國上萬人腹瀉的卵囊對漂白劑和沖洗都有抵抗力，排出一到兩週後才具感染性；實驗室又養不活也驗不出死活，疫情因此難以切斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寄生蟲</span><span class=\"tag\">環孢子蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia&#x27;s Historic Quarter, SaaS Comeback, Bessent vs Druck, America&#x27;s Debt Crisis, Cancer Vaccine harness acqui-hire yield curve suppression neo antigen CAR-T\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-allin-英伟达史上最强财报-估值却只有-12-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02a0f04aec83a63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達史上最強財報，估值卻只有 12 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場不是不信 600 億淨利，而是相信競爭一定會來。史上最賺錢的季度配上史上最便宜的估值，這個組合本身就是這期最反常識的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>"]